MC : Huh!? Me???
Professor Regan : Obviously, who else could it be? you are the one that found the clue, i didnt hire you to be my assistant for nothing #prof : Smirk
Professor Regan : Since its getting late now, i wouldnt recommend you to stay here any longer. Go back home, you may discuss any further matters tommorrow #prof : Neutral
MC : Understood. Thank you Professor
